A second operational defect appeared in the documented setup path: `bootstrap_admin` fails on a fresh migrated database because it targets `ON CONFLICT (username)` while the schema’s uniqueness is the expression index `LOWER(username)`. I’m correcting the conflict target and will add coverage so a fresh install can actually create and then update an admin account.
