codex
Implemented and verified the highest-impact backend/iOS fixes.

What changed:

- Fixed fresh-install admin bootstrap failing against the case-insensitive username index.
- Added backend regression coverage; full suite is now 55 tests.
- Fixed the iOS launch crash caused by force-unwrapping a nil `rootViewController` after UIScene migration.
- Added and embedded the previously missing WidgetKit extension target.
- Fixed widget API URLs producing `/v1/v1/widget/summary`.
- Fixed stale Swift decoding syntax and added native URL regression coverage.
- Updated Simulator operating instructions and [docs/project.md](/Users/fendee/Documents/personal-management/docs/project.md).

Verification results:

- Backend: `55 passed`, one upstream Starlette warning.
- API client: `4 passed`.
- Finance core: `79 passed`.
- User app: `1 passed`.
- Flutter analysis: clean for all three packages.
- Native widget/deep-link XCTest: `4 passed`.
- iOS Simulator build: passed; WidgetKit `.appex` embedded and code signature verified.
- iPhone 13 / iOS 18.6: launch verified in light, dark, and accessibility-extra-large text.
- WidgetKit generated small and medium placeholder timelines successfully.

Evidence:

- [Verification report](/Users/fendee/Documents/personal-management/artifacts/verification-2026-10-04/README.md)
- [Screenshots](/Users/fendee/Documents/personal-management/artifacts/verification-2026-10-04/screenshots)
- [Pre-fix crash result](/Users/fendee/Documents/personal-management/artifacts/verification-2026-10-04/screenshots/iphone13-login-before.png)
- [Post-fix login](/Users/fendee/Documents/personal-management/artifacts/verification-2026-10-04/screenshots/iphone13-login-after-crash-fix.png)
- [Dark/enlarged text](/Users/fendee/Documents/personal-management/artifacts/verification-2026-10-04/screenshots/iphone13-login-dark-large.png)

